u-paragraph-large">Where is Furry Friends located in Jaipur?</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__icon-wrap"><svg class="accordion__icon-plus" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 20 20" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7.84 18.8v-7H1.12V7.88h6.72V.96h4.32v6.92h6.76v3.92h-6.76v7z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg class="accordion__icon-minus" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 20 20" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M3.8 7.9h12.4v4.04H3.8z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></span></summary><div class="accordion__content" data-accordion-content=""><div class="accordion__content-inner"><div class="rich-text w-richtext"><p>We are located at <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Furry+Friends+Jaipur/@26.957327,75.77775,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x396db3188b3a6371:0xa12d24db46015ab9!8m2!3d26.957327!4d75.77775!16s%2Fg%2F11vr9p0hm8?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI2MDkwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #ff9d00; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline;" target="_blank">Ganpati Tower, G-7, near MBA Chai wala, Sector 2, Central Spine, Vidyadhar Nagar, Jaipur, Rajasthan 302039</a>. Open 7 days a week from 9:30 AM to 9:30 PM! We also provide same-day home delivery across Jaipur.</p></div></div></div></details></div><div class="accordion__item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><details class="accordion__details" data-accordion=""><summary class="accordion__summary" data-accordion-summary=""><span class="accordion__title-wrap"><h3 class="accordion__title u-paragraph-large">What areas in Jaipur do you deliver to?</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__icon-wrap"><svg class="accordion__icon-plus" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 20 20" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7.84 18.8v-7H1.12V7.88h6.72V.96h4.32v6.92h6.76v3.92h-6.76v7z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg class="accordion__icon-minus" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 20 20" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M3.8 7.9h12.4v4.04H3.8z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></span></summary><div class="accordion__content" data-accordion-content=""><div class="accordion__content-inner"><div class="rich-text w-richtext"><p>We deliver across all of Jaipur including Malviya Nagar, Vaishali Nagar, C-Scheme, Raja Park, Mansarovar, Vidhyadhar Nagar, Jagatpura, and Agra Road with same-day express doorstep delivery!</p></div></div></div></details></div><div class="accordion__item w-dyn-item" role="listitem"><details class="accordion__details" data-accordion=""><summary class="accordion__summary" data-accordion-summary=""><span class="accordion__title-wrap"><h3 class="accordion__title u-paragraph-large">Are your pet foods and products 100% genuine?</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="accordion__icon-wrap"><svg class="accordion__icon-plus" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 20 20" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7.84 18.8v-7H1.12V7.88h6.72V.96h4.32v6.92h6.76v3.92h-6.76v7z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg class="accordion__icon-minus" fill="none" viewbox="0 0 20 20" width="100%" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M3.8 7.9h12.4v4.04H3.8z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></span></summary><div class="accordion__content" data-accordion-content=""><div class="accordion__content-inner"><div class="rich-text w-richtext"><p>Yes, absolutely! Every single bag of Royal Canin, Farmina, Drools, treats, and supplements is directly sourced from authorized brand distributors with genuine batch seals and fresh expiry dates.</p></div></div></div></details></div></div></div><a class="button-alt w-inline-block" data-button-alt="" data-wf--button-alt--variant="base" href="#faq"><span class="button-alt__text-wrap"><span class="button-alt__bg"></span><span class="button-alt__text-outer"><span class="button-alt__text" data-button-alt-text="">Show all FAQ</span></span></span><span class="button-alt__icon-wrap"><span class="button-alt__bg"></span><span class="button